"%form_id post blocked by CAPTCHA module: challenge %challenge (by "
"module %module), user answered \"@response\", but the solution was "
"\"@solution\"."
msgstr ""
"कॅप्चा मॉड्यूल: चॅलेंज "
"%challenge (मॉड्यूल %module) ने %form_id वर "
"पोस्ट अवरोधित केला; "
"वापरकर्त्याने “@response” हे "
"उत्तर दिले, पण समाधान "
"“@solution” होते."

