"The Colorbox library needs to be <a href=\"@url\">downloaded</a> and "
"extracted into the /libraries/colorbox folder in your Drupal "
"installation directory."
msgstr ""
"Colorbox लायब्ररीला <a "
"href=\"@url\">डाउनलोड</a> करून "
"तुमच्या Drupal स्थापना "
"डिरेक्टरीतील /libraries/colorbox "
"फोल्डरमध्ये एक्स्ट्रॅक्ट "
"(उत्पादित) करणे आवश्यक आहे."

